{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫綜藝節目《試真 D 唷》主持江美儀、朱敏瀚（朱仔）、吳業坤、曾展望（GM）及張振朗，衝出香港去到台北、台南、高雄「試真 D」。</p><p>今集眾人繼續台北素食店清清腸胃，再挑戰創新料理鍋燒意麵，最後到飲湯店試飲大鍋湯，全程爆笑與驚嚇齊飛。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.613220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"f7b2f525a96376b12e0c114685375ef566e82c0f01b05000be83f482b0387620","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}